 SJVLS libraries.","evidence_claim":"Merced County Library lists free transit and delivery of items ordered from member San Joaquin Valley Library System libraries as a library-card privilege.","source_url":"https://www.countyofmerced.com/729/Privileges-Services","source_title":"Privileges & Services | Merced County Library","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Requires a Merced County Library card; interlibrary loans outside the SJVLS may carry a fee.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"merced-library-kanopy","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Merced County Library Kanopy","title":"Host a library-card movie night","subtitle":"Merced County Library digital service","notes":"Pick a title together, sign in with a library card and PIN, and make the hang about discussing the film instead of buying tickets.","short_summary":"A library-card streaming service with free access to thousands of movies.","evidence_claim":"Merced County Library says Kanopy provides free access to thousands of movies when users enter a library-card number and PIN.","source_url":"https://www.countyofmerced.com/1904/Apps-at-Your-Library","source_title":"Apps at Your Library | Merced County Library","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Requires a Merced County Library card number and PIN; use a personal device.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"merced-library-pronunciator","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Merced County Library Pronunciator","title":"Try a language lesson together","subtitle":"Merced County Library digital service","notes":"Choose a language and work through a short Pronunciator lesson side by side, then practice a few phrases on the walk home.","short_summary":"Free online language and ESL courses